OL,3,AGovernment could force media industry
OL,4,Ato improve safeguards after Walliams
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government is prepared to force the
OL,8,Fentertainment industry to improve
OL,9,Fsafeguarding practices unless rapid
OL,10,Fchange is introduced, BBC Newsnight has
OL,11,Flearned.
OL,13,FAn investigation by the Guardian and
OL,14,FITV News alleged that entertainer David
OL,15,FWalliams had been accused by several
OL,16,Fwomen of sexual misconduct and abusing
OL,17,Fhis position, which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
