OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom seals historic win
OL,4,Ain Mississippi Senate race
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe result means the Democrats will
OL,7,Fhold 55 seats in the 100-member Senate,
OL,8,Fwith a knife-edge race in Alaska still
OL,9,Fto be called.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
