OL,3,AIsraeli strike on hospital kills at
OL,4,Aleast five Palestinians, Gaza civil
OL,5,Adefence agency says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA surgeon is reported to be among those
OL,8,Fwho were killed during the strike early
OL,9,Fon Thursday.
OL,11,FThere has been no immediate response
OL,12,Ffrom the Israeli military. The BBC has
OL,13,Fcontacted the Israel Defense Forces for
OL,14,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
